{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19195","headline":"酬乐天衫酒见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬乐天衫酒见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酒法衆传吴米好，舞衣偏尚越罗轻。\n动摇浮蚁香浓甚，装束轻鸿意态生。\n阅曲定知能自适，举杯应叹不同倾。\n终朝相忆终年别，对景临风无限情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}